## Driver call graph

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    MAIN["main(args)"] --> MTTD["makeTreeToDepth(depth)"]
    MTTD --> INIT["init root<br/>pathProb 1.0<br/>bt.leaves = {root}"]
    MTTD --> LOOP["for d in 0..depth-1"]
    LOOP --> ALF["advanceLeafFront(bt, d)"]
    ALF --> EXP["for each leaf n<br/>expand children"]
    EXP --> MERGE["equivalentTo(child, newLeaves)"]
    MERGE -->|hit| ACC["equiv.pathProb += child.pathProb"]
    MERGE -->|miss| ADD["newLeaves.add(child)"]
    ALF --> SWAP["bt.leaves = newLeaves"]
    MTTD --> AGG["{{AGGREGATION_CALL}}"]
```

