        +double pathProb
        +boolean terminated
{{STATE_CLASS_FIELDS}}
        +{{SETBRANCH_NAME}}(...)
    }
```

## Key invariants

- `root.pathProb = 1.0`
- `child.pathProb = parent.pathProb * prob`
- `equivalent(a, b) implies a.level == b.level`
- At every layer: `sum(leaf.pathProb for leaf in bt.leaves) + sum(term.pathProb for term in bt.terminals) ≈ 1.0`

(In log-space mode, replace the second and fourth lines with `child.logPathProb = parent.logPathProb + log(prob)` and `logAdd(logSumPathProb(bt.leaves), logSumPathProb(bt.terminals)) ≈ 0.0`.)

See `resources/patterns/` for details.
